## Key Concepts
- End-to-end streaming tests across Kafka, storage, and materialized views
- Exactly-once and idempotent writes
- Replay/failure scenarios and broker partition events
- Tenant data isolation and deterministic mocks
- Observability: SLA validation and latency metrics

## Code Example
